<title>FRANCE: Lagardere sees double-digit profit gains from 2001.</title>
<headline>Lagardere sees double-digit profit gains from 2001.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Missiles to publishing conglomerate Lagardere expects double-digit profit growth up to the year 2001 on average, chairman Jean-Luc Lagardere told the annual shareholders meeting on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The net attributable result will rise more sharply than turnover. Up to 2001, profit growth should be in two digits, on average,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
